        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学试题页</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#eee;\n    color:#342d29;\n    font-family:\"SimSun\",\"Songti SC\",serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:540px;\n    height:720px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    padding:22px 33px 12px 52px;\n    background:#fff;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    font-size:11px;\n    line-height:1.48;\n  }\n  .problem{position:relative; margin-bottom:12px;}\n  .intro{margin:0 0 3px 0;}\n  .question{margin-left:5px; line-height:1.45;}\n  .solution{margin-top:4px;}\n  .solution b{font-weight:bold;}\n  .eq{margin-left:7px; white-space:nowrap;}\n  .small-eq{margin-left:12px; white-space:nowrap;}\n  .section19{\n    position:relative;\n    margin-top:10px;\n    min-height:302px;\n  }\n  .sec19-text{\n    width:320px;\n    padding-right:4px;\n  }\n  .diagram{\n    position:absolute;\n    right:0;\n    border:0;\n    color:#252525;\n    font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n  }\n  .diagram .caption{\n    display:none;\n  }\n  .diagram-top{top:3px; width:145px; height:126px;}\n  .diagram-bottom{top:157px; width:151px; height:145px;}\n  svg{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}\n  .line{stroke:#333;stroke-width:1}\n  .dash{stroke:#333;stroke-width:.8;stroke-dasharray:3 2}\n  .thin{stroke:#333;stroke-width:.7}\n  .label{font-size:10px; fill:#242424}\n  .bottom-copy{\n    width:320px;\n    margin-top:5px;\n  }\n  .problem20{margin-top:2px;}\n  .cropped{white-space:nowrap;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <section class=\"problem\">\n    <p class=\"intro\">记△ABC的内角A，B，C的对边分别为a，b，c，已知\n      \\(\\dfrac{\\cos A}{1+\\sin A}=\\dfrac{\\sin2B}{1+\\cos2B}\\).</p>\n    <div class=\"question\">(1) 若 \\(C=\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}\\)，求B；</div>\n    <div class=\"question\">(2) 求 \\(\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}\\) 的最小值.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"solution\">\n      <b>【解析】</b>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\dfrac{\\sin2B}{1+\\cos2B}=\\dfrac{2\\sin B\\cos B}{2\\cos^2B}=\\dfrac{\\sin B}{\\cos B}=\\dfrac{\\cos A}{1+\\sin A}\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\sin B+\\sin B\\sin A=\\cos B\\cos A\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\sin B=\\cos B\\cos A-\\sin B\\sin A=\\cos(B+A)=-\\cos C\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\because B,C\\in(0,\\pi),\\ \\therefore \\sin B&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\cos C&lt;0,\\ C&gt;\\dfrac{\\pi}{2},\\ B\\in\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\sin B=-\\cos C=\\sin\\left(C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\Rightarrow B=C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">（1）\\(B=C-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">（2）因为我们有角的关系，我们将其化为角：\\(A=\\pi-B-C=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-2B;\\ C=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+B\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">由正弦定理：\\(\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}=\\dfrac{\\sin^2A+\\sin^2B}{\\sin^2C}=\\dfrac{\\cos^22B+\\sin^2B}{\\cos^2B}\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\qquad=\\dfrac{(2\\cos^2B-1)^2+1-\\cos^2B}{\\cos^2B}\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">令 \\(x=\\cos^2B,\\ x\\in(0,1)\\)，</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}=\\dfrac{4x^2-5x+2}{x}=4x-5+\\dfrac{2}{x}\\ge2\\sqrt8-5=4\\sqrt2-5\\)</div>\n      <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\ 4x=2\\sqrt2\\Rightarrow x=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\) 时取等号</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section19\">\n    <div class=\"sec19-text\">\n      <div><b>19.</b>（12分）</div>\n      <div>如图，直三棱柱 \\(ABC-A_1B_1C_1\\) 的体积为4，△ABC的面积为 \\(2\\sqrt2\\).</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">(1) 求 \\(A_1\\) 到平面 \\(ABC\\) 的距离；</div>\n      <div class=\"question\">(2) 设D为 \\(A_1C_1\\) 的中点，\\(MA=AB\\)，平面 \\(A_1BC\\perp\\) 平面 \\(ABB_1A_1\\)，求二面角 \\(A_1-BD-A\\) 的正弦值．</div>\n\n      <div class=\"solution\">\n        <b>【解析】</b>(1) 设棱 \\(A_1A\\) 到平面 \\(ABC\\) 的距离为h\n        <div class=\"small-eq\">\\(V_{A_1-ABC}=\\dfrac13S_{\\triangle ABC}\\cdot\\dfrac13A_1A=\\dfrac13\\cdot4=\\dfrac43\\)</div>\n        <div class=\"small-eq\">\\(2\\sqrt2h=\\dfrac43\\)，\\(h=\\sqrt2\\)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bottom-copy\">\n        <div>（2）大家应该都能看出 \\(BC\\perp\\) 面 \\(ABB_1A_1\\)，但就是很多人没证出来．</div>\n        <div>题系的意思是AB是垂线，即 \\(AB\\perp\\) 面 \\(A_1B_1A_1\\)，又平面 \\(A_1BC\\perp\\) 平面 \\(ABB_1A_1\\)，所以 \\(A_1B,BC\\perp AB,\\ BC\\perp A_1B\\)，又 \\(A_1B,BC\\) 相交，</div>\n        <div>\\(\\therefore BC\\perp\\) 面 \\(ABB_1A_1\\)，\\(BC\\perp AB\\)（省略了一点步骤，大家考</div>\n        <div>试中不要省）</div>\n        <div>作 \\(MN\\perp BD\\) 于N，易证 \\(\\angle MNA\\) 即为 \\(A_1-BD-A\\) 的平面角，也</div>\n        <div>是一面角（\\(A-BD-C\\) 的补角，画者正误请纠错）。</div>\n        <div>图中各关系都易求，\\(BD=\\sqrt3\\)，等面求得 \\(MN=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{3}\\)，\\(AN=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt2}{3}\\)</div>\n        <div class=\"eq\">\\(\\sin\\angle MNA=\\dfrac{AM}{AN}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram diagram-top placeholder\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: upper-right triangular prism]\">\n      <span class=\"caption\">[Diagram: upper-right triangular prism]</span>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 145 126\">\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"12\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"118\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"66\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"116\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"118\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"67\" y2=\"52\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"67\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"12\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"67\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"118\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"67\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"67\" cy=\"52\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#222\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"41\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#222\"/>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"1\" y=\"10\">A</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"117\" y=\"12\">C₁</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"119\" y=\"88\">C</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"64\" y=\"125\">B</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"56\" y=\"50\">B₁</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"87\" y=\"40\">D</text>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"diagram diagram-bottom placeholder\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: lower-right geometric diagram]\">\n      <span class=\"caption\">[Diagram: lower-right geometric diagram]</span>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 151 145\">\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"10\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"83\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"83\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"133\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"69\" y1=\"133\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"121\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"line\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"133\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"83\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"14\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"49\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"69\" y1=\"49\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"10\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"69\" y1=\"49\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"133\"/>\n        <line class=\"dash\" x1=\"69\" y1=\"49\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"84\"/>\n        <line class=\"thin\" x1=\"24\" y1=\"91\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"48\"/>\n        <line class=\"thin\" x1=\"24\" y1=\"91\" x2=\"89\" y2=\"75\"/>\n        <line class=\"thin\" x1=\"89\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"133\"/>\n        <line class=\"thin\" x1=\"89\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"9\"/>\n        <path class=\"thin\" fill=\"none\" d=\"M27 88 A16 16 0 0 1 40 88\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"89\" cy=\"75\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#222\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"49\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#222\"/>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"3\" y=\"10\">A₁</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"122\" y=\"11\">C₁</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"124\" y=\"88\">C</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"67\" y=\"142\">B</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"3\" y=\"87\">A</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"57\" y=\"47\">B₁</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"91\" y=\"48\">D</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"91\" y=\"78\">N</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"18\" y=\"96\">M</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"22\" y=\"119\">2</text>\n        <text class=\"label\" x=\"101\" y=\"119\">2</text>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"problem problem20\">\n    <div><b>20.</b>（12分）</div>\n    <div class=\"cropped\">——医疗团队为研究某地的一种地方性疾病与当地居民的卫生习惯（卫</div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
